# Code of Conduct

## Our pledge

We are committed to providing a welcoming, respectful, and harassment-free experience for everyone.

## Expected behavior

Be considerate, use inclusive language, respect differing viewpoints, accept constructive feedback, and focus on what is best for the community.

## Unacceptable behavior

Harassment, discrimination, personal attacks, intimidation, doxxing, and publishing private information without consent are not acceptable.

## Scope

This policy applies in project spaces and when an individual is representing the project or its community.

## Reporting

Report concerns privately to the project maintainers using the contact method published in the repository. Include relevant context; do not publish sensitive information in a public issue.

## Enforcement

Maintainers will review reports fairly and may remove content, restrict participation, or take other proportionate action. They will respect reporter confidentiality where possible.
